wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/4 cup real butter</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">3 teaspoons Pecan oil ( or other light oil for frying)</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 teaspoon garlic powder</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 teaspoon salt</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1/2 teaspoon white pepper</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 lime sliced into wedges</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">1 teaspoon minced fresh parsley</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jkk6ep4m":{"pinUrl":"https://www.pinterest.com/pin/637329784744254061/","isConsentPolicyActive":false,"isMobile":false,"translations":{"componentName":"Share from Pinterest","large_element_one_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url> ","large_element_two_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","medium_element_one_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, <url>adjust your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings.<url>","medium_element_two_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, <url>adjust your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings.<url>","small_element_one_cookie":"<url>Update your cookie settings<url>","small_element_two_cookie":"<url>Update your cookie settings<url>","small_tooltip_one_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, update your <%=cookietype%> settings.","small_tooltip_two_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, update your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> settings.","small_element_aria_label":"More info","tiny_element_one_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","tiny_element_two_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","tiny_element_aria_label":"Unblock <%=componentname%>","analytics":"analytics","functional":"functional","essential":"essential","advertising":"marketing"}},"comp-lo1v07ha":{"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-lo1v07ha","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"a11y":{"tabindex":"-1"},"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"translations":{"playLabel":"Play","pauseLabel":"Pause"}},"comp-jkk6ep5q":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Method</span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jkk6ep6r":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Preheat an oven to 400 degrees.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Rinse and pat dry the fish fillets then sprinkle them with the garlic powder, salt and pepper.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Preheat a skillet to medium high heat then add the butter and the pecan oil. When the oils are sizzling it&#39;s time to dredge the fillets&nbsp;in the Wondra and add them&nbsp;to the skillet.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Fry without turning the fish for about 3 minutes then turn only once to sear the other side. </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Transfer the fish to the oven and bake for 10 minutes.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Squeeze plenty of lime over the fish, garnish&nbsp;with the minced&nbsp;parsley and serve immediately.</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-lo1v07hb":{"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-lo1v07hb","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnima